{
  "$schema": "../../specs/erc7730-v2.schema.json",
  "_curation_note": "PQSigner semantic curation: three distribution routes are admitted only for Sei EVM mainnet's native distribution precompile below; withdrawMultipleDelegationRewards remains an exact-known refusal because its dynamic string array cannot be rendered by the authenticated static-primitive array topology. At EVM block 222736384 the address had no EVM runtime or proxy storage, as expected for a native precompile. Independent live nodes reported Sei v6.5.0 and v6.5.2 builds whose target distribution source and ABI are byte-identical; the official v6.5 upgrade was applied at height 208377745. setWithdrawAddress binds the exact EVM destination. Reward and commission claims bind every signed validator string but derive the payout amount from live staking state and send it to the caller's configured Sei withdrawal address. Evidence is historical fixed-block/source authority, not live association, reward, validator, or withdrawal-address state, execution success, future native upgrades, fallback, or blind signing. See tests/erc7730-semantic-evidence/corestake-sei-avvatar.",
  "_pqsigner": {
